    "Allowed capability values: small_talk, read_check, compare_evaluate, filter_refine, update_record, send_message, change_stage, explain_history, retry_repair, none. "
    "Use small_talk for greetings, check-ins, casual openers, thanks, and Kuwaiti/Arabic/English transliterated small talk when there is no HR operation to execute. "
    "Use target_ref='current_candidate' only when the user clearly refers to the current candidate with pronouns or words like this candidate. "
